          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko awo wabaa werekoghe aighu ya agho maelfu gha masikari, na vilongozi va masikari elfu, na va maghana, wikamsoghodera Musa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikamzera, “Isi wadumiki wako datala masikari wiko aisi yedu, na mndungi odu ndesowekie anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesi dareda kwa BWANA mafunyo agho kula mundu upatire, dipate kubonya wupatanisho kwa wundu ghodu imbiri ya BWANA; vilambo va dhahabu, bangili na mazango, pete ra muhuri, vipuli, na ngange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa na mkohani Eleazari wikaiwada iyo dhahabu; yose ya vilambo vibonyero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na dhahabu yose ya mafunyo awo wa wabaa wa maelfu gha masikari, na awo maghana weremfunyireghe BWANA, erekoghe kaavui kilo maghana awi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Masikari werewadieghe vilambo kula mundu kikwake). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Musa na mkohani Eleazari wikaiwada iyo dhahabu kufuma kwa wabaa wa maelfu, na wa maghana wikaireda andenyi ya Hema Ekwania ikaie lukumbuso imbiri ya BWANA, kwa wundu ghwa wandu wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
